{title: 690 - Dismiss Us, Lord With Blessing}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #690 • BENEDICTION • 9.9.10.9.2}
{lyricist: L. E. Froom}
{composer: L. E. Froom}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 690}
{meta: tune BENEDICTION}
{meta: meter 9.9.10.9.2}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Dismiss us, [F/C]Lord, [C]with [G]blessing, [G7]we pray;
[G7]As from Thy worship [C]we go our ways;
[C]Guide in life’s conflicts, [Dm/F]all [F]through [G7/F]the [F]day;
[F/A]Save in [G#7]Thy [C/G]kingdom, Thine [G7/D]be the [C]praise.
[F]Amen.
{end_of_verse}
